📖 Surah 114 (Surah An-Nas) se Related Hadith 

1. Sone se pehle Surah An-Nas parhna

Hadith
Hazrat Aisha (RA) farmati hain:

“Jab Nabi ﷺ bistar par jate, to apne dono hathon par phoonk marte, phir **Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad**, **Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbil Falaq**, aur **Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbin-Nas** parhte, phir apne jism par jahan tak haath pohanchta phairte. Sar, chehra aur jism ke samne ke hisson se shuru karte. Yeh amal teen martaba karte.”

Reference: Sahih Bukhari 5017, Sahih Muslim 2192

Samajh 
* Surah An-Nas hifazat ke liye parhi jati hai
* Nabi ﷺ khud isko daily routine mein parhte the
* Yeh shaitan ke waswasay, nazar aur burai se bachati hai

---

2. Bimari mein Surah An-Nas se Ruqyah

Hadith :
Hazrat Aisha (RA) farmati hain:

“Jab Rasulullah ﷺ bemar hote, to Mu‘awwidhat (Surah Falaq aur Surah Nas) parh kar apne upar phoonk marte. Jab bemari zyada ho gayi, to main yeh suratein parhti aur unka haath unke jism par pherti.”

Reference: Sahih Bukhari 5735, Sahih Muslim 2192

 Samajh

* Surah An-Nas **ruqyah** ke liye use hoti hai
* Bimari, darr, waswasa — sab se protection
* Sunnah hai ke **khud par parh kar phoonk marein**

---

3. Surah Falaq aur Nas ki khas fazilat

Hadith :
Uqbah bin Amir (RA) se riwayat hai ke Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:

“Kya tum ne dekha ke aaj raat aisi ayatein nazil hui hain jin ki misaal nahi? ‘Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbil-Falaq’ aur ‘Qul A‘udhu bi Rabbin-Nas’.”

Reference: Sahih Muslim 814

 Samajh

* Surah Falaq aur **Surah Nas sab se powerful protection** hain
* Yeh specially **waswasah aur shaitan** se bachati hain

---

🌿 Aaj ka Sunnah Amal

* Subah 3 martaba
* Shaam 3 martaba
* Sone se pehle 3 martaba

Yeh Surah hamein sikhati hai:

* Allah hi Rabb-un-Nas
* Allah hi Malik-un-Nas
* Allah hi Ilah-un-Nas
* Sirf Allah se *waswasay se panah* maangni hai
